# Saved global filters, local repair and immutable planning. No discovery starts.
name: Clear conflicting path filters in a scoped study without changing global settings
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_path_filters.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/alpha-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | imported-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | accepted-map
keys: Escape
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: setg taskMode manual
submit: setg tasks secret-scan
submit: setg paths excluded.py
live-snap: saved-global-filter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_path_filters.py @TMP_TARGET @ART filters
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-scopes
keys: p
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | scoped-study
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | conflicting-filters
expect: Earlier path filters conflict
expect: excluded.py
expect: a apply · x clear · Esc cancel
ask: Does the picker name the saved filter and accepted boundary, offer a visible repair, and explain that apply and a new plan are required?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: conflict-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: conflict-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: conflict-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: conflict-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: conflict-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 guarantee. | conflict-small-last
expect: a apply · x clear · Esc cancel
ask: At 40x12, are clear/apply/cancel controls readable and can the complete explanation be paged without changing choices or starting work?
resize: 120x36
keys: x
require-live-snap: 15 Earlier path filters cleared | cleared-draft
expect: Supports this scope
keys: Escape
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 15 Earlier path filters conflict | canceled-repair
expect: excluded.py
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_path_filters.py @TMP_TARGET @ART canceled
ask: Does Esc restore the original filters and selection after clearing only the draft, with global settings unchanged?
keys: x a
require-live-snap: 20 Engine choices updated | applied-repair
expect: Discovery engines  secret-scan
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | finite-repaired-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_path_filters.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does the repaired study bind the accepted scope to three fixed jobs, leave global filters unchanged, and keep execution approval separate?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | restored-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restored-study
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | restored-local-filters
expect: [x] secret-scan
expect: Supports this scope
expect-not: x clear
keys: a
require-live-snap: 15 Engine choices retained | exact-plan-retained
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_path_filters.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: After actual exit and no-color restart, does the study retain its local repair and exact plan while the original global filter remains persisted?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
